CHAPTER.VERS:
In the first 
        year of Darius the son of Ahasuerus, of the seed of the Medes, who was made king over the realm of the Chaldeans; 

          which: or, in which he

And I prayed to the LORD my God, and made my confession, and said, O 
        Lord, the great and dreadful 
        God, keeping the covenant and mercy to them that love him, and to them that keep his commandments;
